docs/ai_methodology/raw/prompts_session_4ffea772_jonreilly.md:2781:1. **`scripts/frontier_su3_triangulated.py`** -- Builds a 3D triangular-prism lattice with proper 3-coloring. Constructs Z_3 staggered phases using omega = e^{2pi*i/3}. Builds 27-dim taste Gamma matrices via the Weyl-Heisenberg (clock-shift) algebra. Tests whether commutator closure generates su(3). Also tests the 3x3 clock and shift matrices directly.
